Cell["\<\
The verified three-argument form returns the same Graphics form and shares \
all display options with bandplot.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"95598553-4ea4-4b41-bcec-c1ed5b2e3619"],

Cell["\<\
A current initialized model is required because the path is selected from the \
lattice metric. Use bandplot[path,npoint,H,rules] when an explicit path is \
required.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"77d5bf81-d15b-4019-a6d7-c32722c434e4"],

Cell["\<\
Usage.wl also advertises showband[path,npoint,H,rules], but the current \
testing implementation misroutes that exact four-argument form through the \
automatic-path overload. This page does not present the unresolved form as \
working behavior.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"834ecae4-0dc3-4458-a112-d3e3f35a331e"],

Cell["\<\
showband returns $Failed and issues a message when automatic path recognition \
fails or any shared bandplot input is invalid. It does not repair the input \
or switch to an approximate fallback.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c221d25a-9c6f-4523-b757-39117ac2840e"],

